4 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h2>Early Bird Offer</h2><p>Available until <strong>31 August 2026</strong>:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Single occupancy:</strong> USD 1,689</p></li><li><p><strong>Double occupancy:</strong> USD 1,295 per person</p></li></ul><p>From <strong>1 September 2026</strong>, the full prices will be:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Single occupancy:</strong> USD 1,875</p></li><li><p><strong>Double occupancy:</strong> USD 1,435 per person</p></li></ul><div class=\"callout-block\" data-callout=\"true\"><p>Perhaps this is just the pause you’ve been needing — a few days to soften, listen inwardly and remember the quiet strength already within you.</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://vigeoretreats.com/retreat/the-wholehearted-woman-retreat/&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Learn more and save your place&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://vigeoretreats.com/retreat/the-wholehearted-woman-retreat/\"><span>Learn more and save your place</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p></p>",
  "body_text": "Sometimes, all we really need is a little space to hear ourselves again.\n\nFrom 1–5 October 2026, I’ll be leading The Wholehearted Woman, a five-day mindfulness retreat near the ancient temples of Angkor in Siem Reap, Cambodia.\n\nThis retreat is an invitation to step away from the many roles we carry — as professionals, partners, mothers, daughters, caregivers and leaders — and reconnect with the human being beneath them all.\n\nOver five days, we will move through a gentle journey of Softening, Listening, Clarity, Strength, and Carrying the Light Home. There will be meditation and mindfulness practices, quiet reflection, time in nature, meaningful conversations, rest, and a special excursion to Angkor.\n\nWe are not retreating from life. \n\nWe are creating enough space to see how we have been living, and how we might return to our everyday lives with greater presence, self-compassion and inner steadiness.\n\nThe retreat will be held at TUI BLUE Angkor Grace Wellness Resort, a beautiful villa-style property in Siem Reap. \n\nThe spacious setting also means that you may choose to bring your family along. While you take part in the retreat programme, they can enjoy their own holiday and time at the resort — and you can still share parts of the journey together outside the scheduled sessions. \n\nPlease reach out to discuss the most suitable accommodation arrangements and any additional considerations for accompanying family members.\n\nYour retreat package includes four nights’ accommodation, full-board meals, airport transfers, retreat sessions and the Angkor excursion.\n\nEarly Bird Offer\n\nAvailable until 31 August 2026:\n\nSingle occupancy: USD 1,689\n\nDouble occupancy: USD 1,295 per person\n\nFrom 1 September 2026, the full prices will be:\n\nSingle occupancy: USD 1,875\n\nDouble occupancy: USD 1,435 per person\n\nPerhaps this is just the pause you’ve been needing — a few days to soften, listen inwardly and remember the quiet strength already within you.\n\nLearn more and save your place\n\n---",
  "truncated_body_text": "Sometimes, all we really need is a little space to hear ourselves again.",
